# Normalize to LF everywhere. Without this, GitHub's windows-latest runners
# (core.autocrlf=true by default) check text files out with CRLF, which broke
# an exact `\n`-anchored regex in tests/package.test.js — Windows-only CI
# failure, unreproducible on Linux/macOS. LF everywhere removes the whole
# class of bug instead of chasing it file by file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary demo assets: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
